  "Strings": {
    "String": [
      {
        "refId": "00373f71-0a87-45ce-a346-7018e0ce3917",
        "string": "Glowing Snail"
      },
      {
        "refId": "ac5ed85b-0885-442a-b040-4dd76cdfd73c",
        "string": "<font size=\"3\">Make the snail show a flash of green light.<br><br></font><font size=\"3\">1. Create this program.</font><br><br><div><div><font size=\"3\">2. Explain to each other how the snail works.</font><br></div></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "01bb1b91-7ec8-4318-c807-eaa10e35d953",
        "string": "<font size=\"3\">Help Max and Mia some more (optional):</font><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">1. Make the light flash lots of times.</font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">2. Program the snail to do other things.</font><br></div></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "17924886-d410-492d-0301-b8d31d7d0c8f",
        "string": "<font size=\"3\">Max and Mia visit an <font color=\"#000000\">aquarium</font>. They see a rare snail.</font><div><font size=\"3\">The snail sends out flashes of green light to communicate.</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">They want to build a model of the snail.&#160;</font></div><font size=\"3\"><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">Max and Mia need your help!&#160;</font></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "f80bd6e0-d87d-46ed-8c39-f4fb0c6d683c",
        "string": "<div><div><div><div><div><div><font size=\"3\">In this lesson, you will learn to:<br><br></font><div><font size=\"3\">•&nbsp;Build a LEGO® model</font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">•&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">Connect your model to your device</span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">• Program</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\">&nbsp;the snail to show a flash of light</span></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
      },
      {
        "refId": "4ffadaa2-539c-4d12-8cc4-4dc428f2d961",
        "string": "<font size=\"3\">Turn on the Smarthub and connect it to your device.</font><br><br>"
      }
    ]
  }
}